Z||000018||1FST2M6||03-12-2000||12:01 AM||||Well actually I just did. BlackGT (member of local Fiero Club and member of this Forum) just bought it about 5 hours ago...  So i get to put it in the weekend of the 25th probly.. Sorry!  If your looking for tuning tips when you  get a kit I can help you out, so can Shaun41179 he too has Nitrous.  MAN that stuffs fun! and SOOO unsuspecting! Take a rather quiet everday driver and with the flip of a single tiny switch turn it into a Fire Breathing Stop light monster ready to thrash anything in its path!! Everone needs to experiance a good nitrous kick in the pants at least once... especially in a Fiero! The scariest Tire smoking, teeth shaking, wheel lifting, 1/8 tank of gas drinking few seconds of your life! YEAH! ||||reg||1
